# Everything the deployed app does not need at runtime.
# The app is index.html + assets/ + api/. Nothing else should be served.
#
# These paths were publicly readable on production until this file existed:
# CLAUDE.md and MASTER_BUILD_GUIDE.md (full internal architecture), migrations/
# (the whole schema), docs/ (bug ledger + planning maps), and .claude/skills/
# (the GHL write matrix and the client price bands). No credential was exposed —
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY in index.html is the intended RLS model — but the pricing
# figures in automation-catalog appear nowhere else in the served surface.
#
# Property: a file listed here is not uploaded to the deployment at all, so it
# can never be served, whatever the request path. Verified safe because no
# api/*.js reads any repo file — if that ever changes, the function needs
# functions.includeFiles in vercel.json rather than removing an entry here.
CLAUDE.md
MASTER_BUILD_GUIDE.md
REFERENCES.md
README.md
gitignore
docs/
migrations/
.claude/
